<PUNCTUATION>##</PUNCTUATION> <HEADING>Blockquotes</HEADING>

<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> Simple blockquote

<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> Multi-line blockquote
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> continues here
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> and here.

<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> Blockquote with other elements
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION>
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> - List item 1
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> - List item 2
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION>
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> ```python
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> print("Code in blockquote")
<PUNCTUATION>&gt;</PUNCTUATION> ```

