<PUNCTUATION>##</PUNCTUATION> <HEADING>Footnotes</HEADING>

Here is a footnote reference[^1] and another[^2].

Here is a named footnote[^named].

[^1]: This is the first footnote.
[^2]: This is the second footnote with multiple paragraphs.

<FUNCTION>    Indented content belongs to the footnote.</FUNCTION>

[^named]: A named footnote for clarity.

<PUNCTUATION>##</PUNCTUATION> <HEADING>Math (LaTeX)</HEADING>

