Display math:

$$
\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!} = \binom{n}{k}
$$

<PUNCTUATION>##</PUNCTUATION> <HEADING>HTML in Markdown</HEADING>

&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Click to expand&lt;/summary&gt;

Hidden content that can be expanded.

<KEYWORD>-</KEYWORD> Can contain <PUNCTUATION>**</PUNCTUATION><CONSTANT>Markdown</CONSTANT><PUNCTUATION>**</PUNCTUATION>
<KEYWORD>-</KEYWORD> With <FUNCTION>`code`</FUNCTION> and other elements

&lt;/details&gt;

&lt;div align="center"&gt;
  &lt;strong&gt;Centered content&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;kbd&gt;Ctrl&lt;/kbd&gt; + &lt;kbd&gt;C&lt;/kbd&gt;

Text with &lt;mark&gt;highlighted&lt;/mark&gt; content.

<PUNCTUATION>##</PUNCTUATION> <HEADING>Escaping</HEADING>

\<PUNCTUATION>*</PUNCTUATION><STRING>Not italic\</STRING><PUNCTUATION>*</PUNCTUATION>

\<PUNCTUATION>**</PUNCTUATION><CONSTANT>Not bold\</CONSTANT><PUNCTUATION>**</PUNCTUATION>

\# Not a header

\<PUNCTUATION>[</PUNCTUATION><STRING>Not a link\</STRING><PUNCTUATION>](</PUNCTUATION><TAG>url</TAG><PUNCTUATION>)</PUNCTUATION>

\<FUNCTION>`Not code\`</FUNCTION>

